  explanation = $EXPL$Correct (C): Under GASB 34, governmental funds use the current financial resources measurement focus and modified accrual basis, so capital asset purchases are reported as expenditures consuming current financial resources. The full $3,000,000 is an expenditure in the General Fund in the period of acquisition.
